        "label_ref": "event_ZOLTAN_PEACE_QUEST_c1_choice",
        "hidden": true
      },
      {
        "label": "Hear them out.",
        "gate": null,
        "child": {
          "text": {
            "value": "They continue. \"We take your silence for interested contemplation.\" They talk at length about peace and harmony, but either it's beyond your simple mind or it's all nonsense.",
            "ref": "event_ZOLTAN_PEACE_QUEST_c2_text"
          },
          "effects": [],
          "node": {
            "kind": "decision",
            "options": [
              {
                "label": "Continue...",
                "gate": null,
                "child": {
                  "text": {
                    "value": "They finish: \"Please, spread the word of enlightenment to those that have not heard. Once you have, contact our brethren.\" They transmit coordinates of their so-called \"brethren\".",
                    "ref": "event_ZOLTAN_PEACE_QUEST_c2_c1_text"
                  },
                  "effects": [
                    {
                      "kind": "quest",
                      "event": "ZOLTAN_PEACE_QUEST2"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                "label_ref": "continue",
                "hidden": true
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "label_ref": "event_ZOLTAN_PEACE_QUEST_c2_choice",
        "hidden": true
      },
      {
        "label": "Leave.",
        "gate": null,
        "child": {
          "text": {
            "value": "The galaxy is at war - there's no time for talk of peace. You leave their hails unanswered and charge the jump drive.",
            "ref": "event_ZOLTAN_PEACE_QUEST_c3_text"
          },
          "effects": []
        },
        "label_ref": "event_ZOLTAN_PEACE_QUEST_c3_choice",
        "hidden": true
      }
    ]
  },
  "chain": [
    {
      "id": "ZOLTAN_PEACE_QUEST2",
      "from": "ZOLTAN_PEACE_QUEST",
      "slug": "zoltan-peace-quest2",
      "title": "Zoltan peace quest — the brethren's coordinates",
      "text": {
        "value": "You arrive at the location specified by the peace-loving Zoltan, but the only thing nearby is a Rebel ship, closing in fast! \"We've found you! You're not getting away this time!\"",
        "ref": "event_ZOLTAN_PEACE_QUEST2_text"
      },
      "name": "ZOLTAN_PEACE_QUEST2",
      "source": "raw/gamedata/events_zoltan.xml",
      "effects": [],
      "node": {
        "kind": "decision",
        "options": [
          {
            "label": "Attack.",
            "gate": null,
            "child": {
              "text": {
                "value": "You power your weapons and prepare to fight.",
                "ref": "event_ZOLTAN_PEACE_QUEST2_c1_text"
              },
              "effects": [
                {
                  "kind": "ship_hostility",
                  "hostile": true
                }
              ]
            },
            "label_ref": "event_ZOLTAN_PEACE_QUEST2_c1_choice",
            "hidden": true
          },
          {
            "label": "Attempt to hail them.",
            "gate": null,
            "child": {
              "text": {
                "value": "They open communications: \"I can't imagine there's anything you could say that will save you. The rebellion must destroy those that are still loyal to the obsolete Federation.\"",
                "ref": "event_ZOLTAN_PEACE_QUEST2_c2_text"
              },
              "effects": [],
              "node": {
                "kind": "decision",
                "options": [
                  {
                    "label": "\"Perhaps there could be a reconciliation of our ideals without war?\"",
                    "gate": null,
                    "child": {
                      "text": {
                        "value": "\"Our ideals are too different to be so easily reconciled. You think this could end any way but war?\"",
                        "ref": "event_ZOLTAN_PEACE_QUEST2_c2_c1_text"
                      },
                      "effects": [],
                      "node": {
                        "kind": "decision",
                        "options": [
                          {
                            "label": "The galaxy is huge - you can find a place for your ideals elsewhere without causing this destruction.",
                            "gate": null,
                            "child": {
                              "text": {
                                "value": "\"No! We will not be consigned to the backwaters of space just because we don't fit into your 'Federation ideals'!\" They charge.",
                                "ref": "event_ZOLTAN_PEACE_QUEST2_c2_c1_c1_text"
                              },
                              "effects": [
                                {
                                  "kind": "ship_hostility",
                                  "hostile": true
                                }
                              ]
                            },
                            "label_ref": "event_ZOLTAN_PEACE_QUEST2_c2_c1_c1_choice",
                            "hidden": true
                          },
                          {
                            "label": "True progress can only be achieved without bloodshed.",
                            "gate": null,
                            "child": {
                              "text": {
                                "value": "Suddenly all indications of the Rebel ship fade away and a Zoltan fleet appears around your ship. The captain of the ship you met previously materializes on your bridge.",
                                "ref": "event_ZOLTAN_PEACE_QUEST2_c2_c1_c2_text"
                              },
                              "effects": [],
                              "node": {
                                "kind": "decision",
                                "options": [
                                  {
                                    "label": "Continue...",
                                    "gate": null,
                                    "child": {
                                      "effects": [],
                                      "node": {
                                        "kind": "chance",
                                        "list": "ZOLTAN_PEACE_QUEST_REWARD",
                                        "dlc": true,
                                        "source": "raw/gamedata/events_zoltan.xml",
                                        "odds_basis": "unweighted",
                                        "options": [
                                          {
                                            "share": null,
                                            "child": {
                                              "text": {
                                                "value": "\"Although your methods are crude and most certainly ineffective, it is clear you took our previous meeting to heart. If your ship represents the Federation's willingness to adapt we shall do what we can to aid in their fight. This technology should aid your quest.\"",
                                                "ref": "event_ZOLTAN_PEACE_QUEST_REWARD_1_text"
                                              },
                                              "effects": [
                                                {
                                                  "kind": "unlock_ship",
                                                  "id": "7"
                                                },
                                                {
                                                  "kind": "reward",
                                                  "level": "LOW",
                                                  "tier": "scrap_only"
                                                },
                                                {
                                                  "kind": "item",
                                                  "item_kind": "augment",
                                                  "id": "ENERGY_SHIELD",
                                                  "label": "Zoltan Shield"
                                                }
                                              ]
                                            }
                                          },
                                          {
                                            "share": null,
                                            "child": {
                                              "text": {
                                                "value": "\"Although your methods are crude and most certainly ineffective, it is clear you took our previous meeting to heart. If your ship represents the Federation's willingness to adapt we shall do what we can to aid in their fight. I will personally assist.\"",
                                                "ref": "event_ZOLTAN_PEACE_QUEST_REWARD_2_text"
                                              },
                                              "effects": [
                                                {
                                                  "kind": "reward",
                                                  "level": "HIGH",
                                                  "tier": "standard"
                                                },
                                                {
                                                  "kind": "unlock_ship",
                                                  "id": "7"
                                                },
                                                {
                                                  "kind": "crew_gain",
                                                  "amount": 1,
                                                  "class": "energy",
                                                  "all_skills": 2,
                                                  "name": "Envoy"
                                                }
                                              ]
                                            }
                                          }
                                        ]
                                      }
                                    },
                                    "label_ref": "continue",
                                    "hidden": true
                                  }
                                ]
                              }
                            },
                            "label_ref": "event_ZOLTAN_PEACE_QUEST2_c2_c1_c2_choice",
                            "hidden": true
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    },
                    "label_ref": "event_ZOLTAN_PEACE_QUEST2_c2_c1_choice",
                    "hidden": true
                  },
                  {
                    "label": "\"Surrender. Your ultimate destruction is inevitable. We've left scores of Rebels destroyed in our wake.\"",
                    "gate": null,
                    "child": {
                      "text": {
                        "value": "They shut off communications and immediately engage.",
                        "ref": "event_ZOLTAN_PEACE_QUEST2_c2_c2_text"
                      },
                      "effects": [
                        {
                          "kind": "ship_hostility",
                          "hostile": true
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    "label_ref": "event_ZOLTAN_PEACE_QUEST2_c2_c2_choice",
                    "hidden": true
                  },
                  {
                    "label": "\"Your Rebellion is causing millions of deaths. Your beliefs are dividing the galaxy. Unity is the only option!\"",
                    "gate": null,
                    "child": {
                      "text": {
                        "value": "\"Humans are treated as 'equal' to aliens in the weak Federation. The sacrifice of BILLIONS of alien or human lives are justified if it means we reach our full potential!\" They charge.",
                        "ref": "event_ZOLTAN_PEACE_QUEST2_c2_c3_text"
                      },
                      "effects": [
                        {
                          "kind": "ship_hostility",
                          "hostile": true
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    "label_ref": "event_ZOLTAN_PEACE_QUEST2_c2_c3_choice",
                    "hidden": true
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            "label_ref": "event_ZOLTAN_PEACE_QUEST2_c2_choice",
            "hidden": true
          }
